      "side": 1,
      "message": "This concerns me a bit.  It means that if anyone defines the above CONFIG and the default PHY is the CCD PHY then even when it should be disabled there is a path into the EC over USB that could be used to exploit a bug in the USB driver stack...\n\nA better solution might be to change usb_init to take the PHY to enable?  Then it could be called here with the CCD PHY and in main or wherever else it\u0027s done with the other PHYs.",
